<?php $groups=json_decode('{"Planning your journey":[["How do I join a trip?","Send an enquiry. We will discuss availability, itinerary and pricing before any commitment."],["Can I travel solo?","Solo travellers can enquire. Room sharing and single-room costs depend on the departure."],["Can friends or couples join together?","Yes, enquire together and tell us your room preferences."],["How large are the groups?","Group size varies by departure; ask for the confirmed capacity."],["Are dates guaranteed?","No. Dates, availability and itineraries remain provisional until confirmed in writing."],["Can I request a private or custom trip?","Send your preferred dates, destination and group size through the contact form."],["Is there a minimum age?","Age requirements depend on the trip and activities. Ask before making plans."],["Can I extend my stay?","Ask about extensions before flights or accommodation are arranged. Additional costs may apply."]],"Pricing and reservations":[["What does the price include?","Refer to the individual itinerary and written quote for confirmed inclusions and exclusions."],["Why are prices not displayed?","Request a quote for your preferred departure. Flight and accommodation costs can change."],["Does an enquiry reserve a seat?","No. An enquiry is not a reservation or payment."],["Can I pay online?","Online card payments are not currently offered. Ask about approved payment arrangements."],["Is a deposit required?","Any deposit amount, due date and conditions must be confirmed in writing before payment."],["Are instalments available?","Ask whether a payment schedule is available for your departure."],["What is the cancellation policy?","Request the applicable written cancellation and refund terms before committing. Supplier restrictions may apply."],["What if the trip is cancelled?","The applicable written terms will explain cancellation options and any refunds."],["Are optional activities extra?","Unless expressly included, optional experiences are additional expenses."],["How much spending money should I bring?","Allow for excluded meals, optional activities, shopping, tips and emergencies. Ask for a destination-specific estimate."]],"Flights and accommodation":[["Are flights included?","Only if stated in your confirmed quote."],["Where do trips depart from?","Check the individual itinerary. Ask about alternative departure airports."],["Is checked baggage included?","Baggage allowances depend on the confirmed airline and fare."],["Can I choose my seat or upgrade?","Airline rules, availability and additional charges apply."],["What hotels will we stay in?","Accommodation details will be confirmed for each departure."],["Can I have a private room?","Ask about availability and any single-room supplement."],["Are airport transfers included?","Check your confirmed inclusions and arrival arrangements."],["How do we travel between cities?","Transport varies by itinerary and may include trains, vehicles or flights."]],"Visas, health and safety":[["Do I need a visa?","Requirements depend on your passport, residence status, transit countries and destination. Verify with official immigration authorities."],["Do you guarantee visa approval?","No. Immigration authorities make all visa decisions."],["Can you help with visa applications?","Ask what administrative guidance is available. You remain responsible for eligibility and accurate documents."],["How long must my passport be valid?","Check official entry and transit rules for your nationality and itinerary."],["Do I need travel insurance?","Comprehensive medical and trip cancellation coverage is strongly recommended; check any mandatory requirements."],["What if I become ill abroad?","Seek local medical assistance and contact your insurer and trip contact. Coverage depends on your policy."],["Can you accommodate accessibility needs?","Tell us your requirements before committing so suitability can be assessed."],["Are adventure activities mandatory?","No optional activity is required; check physical requirements and provider restrictions."]],"During your trip":[["Are meals included?","Only meals specified in your confirmed itinerary are included."],["Can vegetarian or vegan travellers join?","Tell us your dietary needs in advance. Availability varies by destination."],["Can food allergies be accommodated?","Disclose allergies before booking; cross-contact cannot be guaranteed absent."],["Will there be free time?","Check the daily itinerary for scheduled activities and independent time."],["Is internet or an eSIM included?","Check the confirmed inclusions and device compatibility."],["What happens if weather changes plans?","Activities may be changed for safety or operational reasons. Applicable supplier and trip terms govern alternatives."],["Can I skip an activity?","Discuss this with the trip contact; unused inclusions may not be refundable."],["How do I access my itinerary?","Registered travellers can sign in to the traveller portal after their trip is assigned."],["How do I contact you?","Use the contact form for questions about departures, arrangements or your account."]]}',true);?><section class="faq-head"><span class="eyebrow">Before you go</span><h1>Good to know.</h1><p>Everything you need to know before your next journey.</p><label class="faq-search">Find an answer<input id="faq-search" type="search" placeholder="Search flights, visas, payments…"></label></section><div class="faq-layout"><aside class="faq-nav"><?php foreach($groups as $name=>$items):?><a href="#faq-<?=md5($name)?>"><?=h($name)?></a><?php endforeach;?></aside><div><?php foreach($groups as $name=>$items):?><section class="faq-group" id="faq-<?=md5($name)?>"><h2><?=h($name)?></h2><?php foreach($items as [$question,$answer]):?><details><summary><?=h($question)?></summary><p><?=h($answer)?></p></details><?php endforeach;?></section><?php endforeach;?><p id="faq-empty" hidden>No matching questions. Try another search or contact us.</p><a class="btn" href="?page=contact">Still have a question? Contact us</a></div></div>